{"id":"625235","name":"皮蛋蛋豆腐腐","author":"⁶₆ZQY₆⁶","authorId":"12229186","desc":"","cover":"images/625235/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"内脂豆腐","amount":"一盒"}],"sub":[{"name":"皮蛋","amount":"两个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备豆腐和皮蛋（拍照时候拿错成鸭蛋了）。","img":"images/625235/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"这个是正确的，皮蛋。","img":"images/625235/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"豆腐和皮蛋直接切块摆盘码好。","img":"images/625235/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"用姜、蒜、蒜、生抽、郫县豆瓣酱、香醋、香油、香菜碎调小料汁。","img":"images/625235/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"淋在豆腐上。","img":"images/625235/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"最后烧点热油，淋在皮蛋豆腐上。","img":"images/625235/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"ok，开吃！","img":"images/625235/step_7.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}